Licensing of src/ode and include/ode
====================================

These directories contain code and headers corresponding to Open Dynamics
Engine version 0.5, together with reconstructed changes and game-specific
additions.

Upstream ODE portions are redistributed under the historical ODE BSD-style
alternative, reproduced below. All existing ODE copyright, authorship and
licensing headers are preserved.

Some files contain modifications or additions originally made by the game's
developer or another third party. This project does not represent that
independently copyrightable third-party modifications are covered by CC0.
CC0 applies only to qualifying project-original rights held by contributors.

Some ODE TriMesh sources refer to or interface with OPCODE. This notice does
not grant rights in separately obtained OPCODE material.


